WEBVTT

00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:07.360
Uh, Hitsugi-tan, what are you doing?

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:09.980
Huh? What's the matter?

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:11.860
Isn't it obvious?

00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:14.360
Why are you only wearing an underwear?!

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:18.240
Hey, hey. Forgot already?

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:20.620
This isn't what I usually wear, you know?

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:23.540
Wondering why it's too revealing?

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:29.300
This is to celebrate the DVD and Blu-ray release of Triage X.

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:31.420
Here's a bonus!

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:34.930
Oh! It's a schoolgirl's uniform!

00:00:35.510 --> 00:00:37.600
In addition, a bikini armor.

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:40.180
Huh, is this even anime?

00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:43.810
Black Label is a meeting place for women, which means...

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:46.310
Naturally, the resemblance is striking.

00:00:46.310 --> 00:00:49.190
So, what do you mean by that?

00:00:49.190 --> 00:00:52.070
You're going to compare yourself with the others?

00:00:52.070 --> 00:00:54.900
I will not lose to anyone else!

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:57.160
For example, Tsurugi-sensei...

00:00:57.160 --> 00:00:58.490
Mikki-chan?

00:00:58.780 --> 00:01:01.490
She needs to wear this kind of clothing.

00:01:05.540 --> 00:01:07.330
Who would wear something like that?

00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:10.960
She's an idol otaku.

00:01:11.630 --> 00:01:14.220
So it's also her thing.

00:01:16.430 --> 00:01:18.640
I guess, you're right.

00:01:18.930 --> 00:01:22.220
Or it could be worse.

00:01:22.430 --> 00:01:23.730
What's that?

00:01:23.980 --> 00:01:27.020
But Nakamiya isn't that "worthy."

00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:28.350
She's not a real opponent.

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:30.110
What are you saying?!

00:01:30.310 --> 00:01:33.030
The real rival is... actually...

00:01:37.450 --> 00:01:38.910
Yuko-sensei!

00:01:39.240 --> 00:01:41.910
But where can she find that costume?

00:01:42.660 --> 00:01:45.500
Huh, are you talking about bunny ears?

00:01:45.620 --> 00:01:49.540
Uh... that's quite an answer...

00:01:49.710 --> 00:01:50.960
Wait...

00:01:52.250 --> 00:01:54.710
It would look strange and sloppy.

00:01:54.760 --> 00:01:57.680
If you say that, many will get angry!

00:01:57.930 --> 00:01:59.340
I can't be compared.

00:01:59.430 --> 00:02:00.930
What are you thinking?

00:02:01.470 --> 00:02:03.220
How about, Mikko-chin?

00:02:03.260 --> 00:02:05.560
Mikoto? She's...

00:02:07.230 --> 00:02:09.020
Maybe like this?

00:02:09.650 --> 00:02:12.320
Or like this?

00:02:12.360 --> 00:02:16.070
She's shy, so a swimsuit will match her well.

00:02:16.150 --> 00:02:19.660
If she's more bolder, she'd be a worthy opponent.

00:02:19.820 --> 00:02:22.030
She's not to be taken lightly.

00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:24.450
We need to think more seriously.

00:02:26.250 --> 00:02:28.120
How about you Oriha?

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:30.710
Eh, I'm still the usual.

00:02:30.710 --> 00:02:32.250
Like always.

00:02:45.310 --> 00:02:47.350
I can't contain myself.

00:02:47.350 --> 00:02:50.350
But wait, there's more!

00:02:50.600 --> 00:02:55.530
Isho-tan is the one who makes my costumes. They're different from each other.

00:02:55.650 --> 00:02:59.610
Ah, I need to hurry and get my own concert album!

00:02:59.650 --> 00:03:02.570
Isn't she exciting?

00:03:13.630 --> 00:03:15.920
What a nice day, today.

00:05:00.270 --> 00:05:02.650
Whoever killed Togo Itaru, is this guy?

00:05:04.820 --> 00:05:08.280
Mikki, you hear me? I'm facing a masked man.

00:05:08.490 --> 00:05:10.790
He's fast and aggressive!

00:05:13.410 --> 00:05:14.500
Time for action!

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:16.120
Yuko, wait, she's...

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:24.840
Papa...

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:40.980
Her state?

00:05:40.980 --> 00:05:42.900
The wound's healing.

00:05:43.320 --> 00:05:47.110
She regained consciousness, but
her condition's still the same.

00:05:47.740 --> 00:05:50.120
As expected to what demons have done to her.

00:05:50.410 --> 00:05:52.910
Not on material, but on the victim.

00:05:53.240 --> 00:05:56.410
Honestly, I'm surprised she's still alive.

00:05:56.410 --> 00:05:59.460
Surviving until the end of the week.

00:05:59.830 --> 00:06:02.250
There'll be no development if this continues.

00:06:02.250 --> 00:06:04.130
Open up. I'm going in.

00:06:10.390 --> 00:06:13.220
Today, there's milk and white stew.

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:16.140
I also brought apples, they're good.

00:06:22.190 --> 00:06:24.650
You need to eat this while it's hot.

00:06:25.860 --> 00:06:27.820
If you won't, I'll eat it myself.

00:06:30.360 --> 00:06:32.070
You must be hungry, right?

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:34.410
There's nothing you won't like.

00:06:34.910 --> 00:06:37.620
It's good, you know. White stew.

00:06:37.620 --> 00:06:39.870
Everyone loves it.

00:06:42.040 --> 00:06:43.540
Come, let's eat together.

00:06:43.590 --> 00:06:44.460
Not again!

00:06:45.050 --> 00:06:46.670
Let's eat.

00:06:46.670 --> 00:06:50.260
Let's eat... Let's eat...

00:06:53.050 --> 00:06:53.970
Yuko!

00:07:12.240 --> 00:07:14.330
This is at least the 14th test.

00:07:15.450 --> 00:07:19.460
We already tried 15 times. As I said, it's impossible.

00:07:19.460 --> 00:07:21.170
She'll just return to being psychopathic.

00:07:30.340 --> 00:07:32.930
Past traumas.

00:07:32.930 --> 00:07:34.430
Memories that are still unclear.

00:07:35.050 --> 00:07:41.190
The injuries' healing, but the mind's not improving, is it?

00:07:42.230 --> 00:07:44.810
She'll be staying in isolation.

00:07:45.440 --> 00:07:48.940
We don't know if she'll return to normal or not.

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:53.070
However, she'll never improve if
we continue to isolate her,

00:07:53.070 --> 00:07:57.080
and in the wort case, we don't
know if she'll ever come out.

00:07:57.160 --> 00:07:58.700
Let me handle it.

00:07:59.160 --> 00:08:00.290
Yuko?

00:08:00.290 --> 00:08:04.000
Let me take care of Hitsugi Sayo!

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:05.630
But, you're...

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:08.880
I'm her savior.

00:08:09.260 --> 00:08:12.130
I killed her once and then saved.

00:08:12.720 --> 00:08:14.800
But she had no idea...

00:08:14.800 --> 00:08:17.890
As her savior, I refuse it to be continued!

00:08:18.810 --> 00:08:22.390
My job's not finished yet.

00:08:45.120 --> 00:08:46.670
Good!

00:08:56.220 --> 00:08:57.390
Morning!

00:08:57.390 --> 00:08:59.390
I brought you breakfast.

00:09:05.190 --> 00:09:08.400
Today I brought a hamburger.

00:09:08.610 --> 00:09:10.190
It's good, you know.

00:09:13.490 --> 00:09:17.990
Our cook is the best, so it's very good.

00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:28.380
Yuko!

00:09:58.990 --> 00:10:04.580
Yuko... seriously? You're really
serious about treating her?

00:10:05.450 --> 00:10:08.040
Ah, Mikki, what is it?

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:08.790
Yuko, you're...

00:10:08.790 --> 00:10:10.170
I can't.

00:10:10.540 --> 00:10:12.880
It's time I end this.

00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:14.050
But...

00:10:17.510 --> 00:10:20.470
Her pulse is dropping, don't let go. Please stay!

00:10:22.430 --> 00:10:23.760
No response.

00:10:26.020 --> 00:10:27.560
Heart massage!

00:10:27.560 --> 00:10:28.690
Don't die!

00:10:28.690 --> 00:10:31.110
Don't die, please don't die!

00:10:37.030 --> 00:10:38.240
But...

00:10:38.240 --> 00:10:47.410
Again... If she never recovers, you'll be the one suffering.

00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:53.290
You're wrong... It's not me who'll suffer.

00:10:54.340 --> 00:10:58.970
Trapped in the dark, without being able to ask for help.

00:10:58.970 --> 00:11:00.800
The feeling in her heart.

00:11:12.020 --> 00:11:13.560
I know...

00:11:13.560 --> 00:11:14.360
But...

00:11:15.190 --> 00:11:16.360
I believe that...

00:11:16.360 --> 00:11:20.110
Can't stop worrying about Yuko.

00:11:20.110 --> 00:11:21.860
What a big heart.

00:11:21.860 --> 00:11:26.290
Shinichiro, since when are you here? Seriously, go away.

00:11:27.410 --> 00:11:29.540
Still not growing?

00:11:30.660 --> 00:11:32.670
No, it might be my imagination.

00:11:37.840 --> 00:11:38.670
Jeez...

00:11:38.710 --> 00:11:43.430
There can be no one, right? Because
I love you, I became curious,

00:11:43.430 --> 00:11:45.800
because I love and worry about you.

00:11:45.800 --> 00:11:47.810
I kissed you, because I love you.

00:11:55.360 --> 00:11:57.150
You look beautiful.

00:11:57.610 --> 00:11:58.070
Hm.

00:12:18.550 --> 00:12:21.420
I wonder if she likes onigiri.

00:12:21.670 --> 00:12:22.840
Yuko!

00:12:23.180 --> 00:12:25.970
It won't taste good without these.

00:12:33.810 --> 00:12:35.940
They don't look good at all.

00:12:35.940 --> 00:12:37.270
It's fine!

00:12:37.270 --> 00:12:39.270
As long as it's edible.

00:12:39.780 --> 00:12:43.740
Why? I'm much more feminine than you.

00:12:44.950 --> 00:12:47.070
We need to get married first.

00:12:47.200 --> 00:12:48.780
M-Maybe.

00:12:48.910 --> 00:12:54.160
※ 9 men in total, 29 years, currently unmarried.

00:12:54.420 --> 00:12:55.170
Well!

00:12:55.170 --> 00:12:57.380
I'll give her the food now, open the door.

00:12:58.130 --> 00:12:59.380
Picnic?

00:13:10.680 --> 00:13:12.020
Picnic...

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:16.100
I made you a snack, eat, ok?

00:13:19.610 --> 00:13:20.860
I wonder if she'll like it.

00:13:21.610 --> 00:13:23.360
Let's hope for sure.

00:13:50.350 --> 00:13:51.430
We did it.

00:13:51.430 --> 00:13:52.220
Yes.

00:13:52.220 --> 00:13:57.480
Finally, she's recovering.

00:13:57.480 --> 00:14:00.270
Mine was definitely her favorite.

00:14:00.650 --> 00:14:04.110
Jeez, but what a relief.

00:14:04.110 --> 00:14:06.280
It seems she's starting to eat.

00:14:07.570 --> 00:14:09.450
Well, here's your lunch.

00:14:32.850 --> 00:14:34.600
Don't rush!

00:14:34.600 --> 00:14:36.730
Here, drink some water.

00:14:40.520 --> 00:14:41.860
It'll be fine.

00:14:42.230 --> 00:14:44.230
Let papa take care of everything.

00:14:44.320 --> 00:14:47.320
It's fine, it doesn't hurt.

00:14:47.400 --> 00:14:48.320
Ok?

00:15:01.580 --> 00:15:02.630
Yuko!

00:15:12.390 --> 00:15:16.140
It's okay. I won't let those memories hurt you.

00:15:16.720 --> 00:15:17.850
It's okay.

00:15:19.310 --> 00:15:22.520
Because I'm... your savior.

00:15:34.280 --> 00:15:37.200
This time she cried.

00:15:37.870 --> 00:15:40.040
These are more than adequate results.

00:15:47.050 --> 00:15:49.550
You're bringing Hitsugi Sayo out?

00:15:49.920 --> 00:15:50.510
Yes.

00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:54.140
I'm sure it will be beneficial for her health

00:15:54.140 --> 00:15:57.560
You... Do you understand the trouble it might cause?

00:15:57.970 --> 00:16:00.140
Yes, I know.

00:16:00.180 --> 00:16:05.190
If she goes on a rage, she might injure someone.

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:08.820
If it's to save her, I'll do anything.

00:16:09.230 --> 00:16:11.740
As long as I can.

00:16:12.320 --> 00:16:16.240
Fiona, I beg you, give me permission
to bring Hitsugi Sayo out!

00:16:17.950 --> 00:16:18.990
Fine.

00:16:20.950 --> 00:16:22.080
Chief?

00:16:22.080 --> 00:16:25.460
If that's good for her...

00:16:25.460 --> 00:16:28.420
However, we will monitor you.

00:16:28.920 --> 00:16:31.760
Just to be sure...

00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:35.680
Yes. I will do my best.

00:16:36.800 --> 00:16:40.970
Well... I give you permission to bring Hitsugi Sayo out.

00:16:46.770 --> 00:16:51.490
What a nice day! It's great to have a picnic.

00:16:52.490 --> 00:16:55.910
Right, a picnic in this beautiful day, is quite nice.

00:16:56.370 --> 00:17:01.080
You can see the sights, play as much
as you like, and eat onigiri.

00:17:01.950 --> 00:17:05.370
Eh? Stop hiding and come out.

00:17:07.580 --> 00:17:08.750
Jeez...

00:17:10.420 --> 00:17:14.840
No... no!

00:17:36.070 --> 00:17:39.910
It's fine, there's nothing scary when you relax.

00:17:59.090 --> 00:18:01.760
If you sleep after eating, insects will come!

00:18:04.730 --> 00:18:07.020
Just kidding! It's a joke.

00:18:15.530 --> 00:18:17.740
I'll see if we can get drinks.

00:18:32.040 --> 00:18:35.010
Heh, she's pretty cute.

00:18:35.010 --> 00:18:37.590
Hey, hey, Miss, are you alone?

00:18:37.970 --> 00:18:41.390
Hey, you don't need to be afraid.

00:18:41.390 --> 00:18:45.180
We just want to play with you.

00:18:50.940 --> 00:18:52.440
What the—?

00:19:00.860 --> 00:19:03.950
Don't underestimate us!

00:19:22.550 --> 00:19:24.930
Take your friend and go away.

00:19:25.310 --> 00:19:27.720
Currently, I don't want to hurt you.

00:19:32.020 --> 00:19:34.440
You laid hands on civilians.

00:19:34.900 --> 00:19:37.030
What you did is not good.

00:19:37.980 --> 00:19:40.740
Don't use your strength to this sort of thing.

00:19:41.320 --> 00:19:45.120
Because your savior won't forgive you.

00:19:49.040 --> 00:19:50.870
Thank you.

00:19:51.620 --> 00:19:53.130
You're clever.

00:20:00.130 --> 00:20:04.800
Oh jeez. You always arrive at the right time, Yuko.

00:20:06.390 --> 00:20:09.640
From now on, you're free.

00:20:20.820 --> 00:20:21.820
My eyes...

00:20:21.820 --> 00:20:24.200
Stop moving or it will get worse.

00:20:25.370 --> 00:20:27.990
Let me wash your hair.

00:20:31.910 --> 00:20:34.710
That's right! Try to wash them together.

00:20:35.630 --> 00:20:37.790
Let's do this, okay?

00:20:37.790 --> 00:20:39.380
I'll rinse your body.

00:20:39.590 --> 00:20:40.630
Turn around.

00:20:41.970 --> 00:20:43.180
I'm glad.

00:20:45.090 --> 00:20:47.680
Your wound is gone.

00:20:48.810 --> 00:20:50.770
I'm really glad.

00:21:00.320 --> 00:21:03.950
Yuko-sensei, love you.

00:21:04.530 --> 00:21:05.910
Oh, kid.

00:21:09.490 --> 00:21:11.080
So nice!

00:21:12.620 --> 00:21:15.540
In the past, you were so cute.

00:21:15.710 --> 00:21:17.580
What are you talking about?

00:21:17.630 --> 00:21:20.460
I'm even cuter now, right?

00:21:22.300 --> 00:21:24.670
Your wound's gone, isn't it?

00:21:25.680 --> 00:21:29.050
Yep, they're in the past now.

00:21:29.300 --> 00:21:34.810
Aww, the young Hitsugi was much cuter.

00:21:34.810 --> 00:21:36.980
A little bit tsundere now.

00:21:36.980 --> 00:21:38.980
Jeez, what's that?

00:21:38.980 --> 00:21:40.900
Hey, stop moving!

00:21:40.900 --> 00:21:43.030
The soap's getting in my eyes!

00:21:43.030 --> 00:21:46.320
Just stop already, will you!

00:21:46.320 --> 00:21:49.660
Hitsugi, do you want me to kiss you?
